  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two sets of words",
     "texto": [
      "In Japanese there are different words for **your** family and for **someone else's** family. The words for other people's family are more polite.",
      "Your father is **ちち**; someone else's father is **おとうさん**. Your mother is **はは**; someone else's mother is **おかあさん**.",
      "Also, siblings are told apart by age: there is no plain word for «brother»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Family",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "English",
